90.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108590.patch","merged_at":"2025-07-18T16:09:30Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nRelated: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108554\r\n\r\nThe description isn't really true and can lead to confusion. I think the functionality is useful, so it should be made clearer what it does.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\nIf [code]true[/code], automatically expands property groups in the Inspector dock when opening a scene that hasn't been opened previously. If [code]false[/code], all groups remain collapsed by default.\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n\r\nIf [code]true[/code], automatically unfolds Inspector property groups containing modified values when opening a scene for the first time. Only affects scenes without saved folding preferences and only unfolds groups with properties that have been changed from their default values.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/pri